            "\\label{sec:training_details}\n",
            "\\paragraph{More details of training and computations.}\n",
            "We use 4 Nvidia A100 with 80GB memory to train our models. All models are trained for 3 epochs with a batch size of 128, a peak learning rate of 2e-5 with 3\\\n",
            "We run inference of our trained models using 1-2 Quadro RTX 6000 GPUs with 24GB memory. \n",
